json5/eigen-key
description: Unquoted ECMAScript 5.1 identifier name, or a single-quoted string
- >
  The key spellings JSON5 adds over JSON — a bare ECMAScript 5.1 identifier name (letters,
  digits, `$` and `_`, not starting with a digit), or a single-quoted string for anything else:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  age   $ref   _private   'first name'
